<header class="ed-hero bg-inverse pb-14 pt-32 text-inverse-ink md:pt-40"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6"><p class="mb-4 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-accent">The Naked Tech field guide</p><h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight md:text-5xl">External drive or cloud: choosing a computer backup destination</h1><p class="ed-deck">Both can be valid. The better fit depends on your routine, access needs and tolerance for each option&#x27;s limitations.</p></div></header>
<article class="ed-guide bg-canvas py-12 md:py-16" aria-label="External drive or cloud: choosing a computer backup destination"><div class="ed-layout">
