<div class="ed-reading guide-reading text-lg">
<p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">There is no universal winner between an external drive and cloud storage. Compare the destination with the files you need to protect, the way you work and what you can reliably maintain. A destination is only useful if the right files reach it and you can safely retrieve them later.</p>
<section class="ed-start" id="start" aria-labelledby="start-heading"><p class="ed-label">Start here</p><h2 id="start-heading">Compare the real trade-offs</h2><p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">Use the questions below as a decision aid, not a product ranking. Examples are labelled examples, and provider features can change.</p><div class="ed-choices">
